{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33885","headline":"临顿爲吴中偏胜之地陆鲁望居之不出郛郭旷若郊墅余每相访欵然惜去因成五言十首奉题屋壁 三 · 皮日休","name":"临顿爲吴中偏胜之地陆鲁望居之不出郛郭旷若郊墅余每相访欵然惜去因成五言十首奉题屋壁 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茧稀初上簇，醅尽未乾牀。\n尽日留蚕母，移时祭麴王。\n趁泉浇竹急，候雨种莲忙。\n更葺园中景，应爲顾辟疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}